  CardStory: "But it is being done for a reason, he knows. I don\u2019t. That is\u2026
    Smothering. I need to understand, in order to act. Spades2 looks in the mirror
    and thinks of something, but I am not sure of what. What was I thinking? Why
    didn\u2019t Spades2 think of it with me?\r\n\r\nIs there a mirror? I haven\u2019t
    seen a mirror for some time. Spades2 adjust his lapel absentmindedly. \r\n\r\nHis
    reflection takes a moment to follow suit.\r\n\r\nSpades2 shivers, the world snaps
    back into place. But now there is a divide where the lines were muddled, like
    a shard of broken glass. It digs into him and forces him to consider. What has
    he been doing? Why is there a mirror here? Why is the thing in the mirror not
    the man he remembers?\r\n\r\nWait. WAIT.\r\n\r\nCAN YOU SEE ME?"
